Subject: [PATCH 2659/3799] soh: rename D_8082AFC8 -> sPageVtxHeights1

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the heights in slot 1 of the sPageVtxHeights table
Defined in soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c    | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c b/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
index c3c041cbd..ee946ae54 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
@@ -2686,7 +2686,8 @@ static s16 sPageVtxHeights0[] = {  // was D_8082AFC4 [LLM:HIGH]
     0x0000,
     0x0000,
 };
-static s16 D_8082AFC8[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_8082AFC8: the heights in slot 1 of the sPageVtxHeights table
+static s16 sPageVtxHeights1[] = {  // was D_8082AFC8 [LLM:HIGH]
     0x0000,
     0x0000,
 };
@@ -2715,7 +2716,7 @@ static s16* D_8082B030[] = {
 };
 
 static s16* D_8082B048[] = {
-    sPageVtxHeights0, D_8082AFC8, D_8082AFCC, D_8082AFF0, sCloudTexHeights, D_8082AFF4,  // was D_8082AB2C [LLM:HIGH]
+    sPageVtxHeights0, sPageVtxHeights1, D_8082AFCC, D_8082AFF0, sCloudTexHeights, D_8082AFF4,  // was D_8082AB2C [LLM:HIGH]
 };
 
